      "writtenOn": "2026-11-10T06:13:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please validate the full header read and the expected table length before decoding/allocating. count * 4 can overflow (a count of 2^30 with no table is accepted); negative counts and truncated headers throw unchecked IllegalArgumentException / ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException where the javadoc promises IOException. When adopting the native layout, derive N from the .idx, use checked arithmetic, and report malformed input as IOException.",
