      "writtenOn": "2026-11-10T06:13:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is not native Git\u0027s .mtimes format: the magic must be MTME (not MTIM), the third word is the hash-function id (N comes from the companion .idx, not a stored count), and a pack-checksum + file-checksum trailer is required. Verified both ways: native repack rejects this output (exit 128, \"unknown signature\"); this loader throws IOException on native output. Please implement the native layout in writer and reader and add round-trip interop tests. Changing only the magic is not sufficient.",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "805a9eb9f30942d3c10afb060277afdf6c1add27",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
